  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes the continent’s coastline or terrain map beyond its place among Lang Ya’s four continents and the black and brown hair of its hairy men.",
      "chapters": [
        1049
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya blessed land has four continents. Three lie on the sea with similar sizes. The fourth and smallest floats in the sky as Cloud Cover Continent. Black Hair Continent is one of the three sea continents, and Steel Thread City is its grandest city, with hundreds of thousands of hairy men in the city alone. Hairy men there have black and brown hair as their natural hair color. Narration calls Steel Thread City’s trading market one of the most famous markets on the continent.",
      "chapters": [
        1049
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "loc_cloud_cover_continent",
        "loc_steel_thread_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Black Hair Continent joins with White Hair Continent against Yellow Hair Continent. Black Hair King rules from the imperial city and decrees a martial competition after the Cloud Cover Continent immortal miracle.",
      "chapters": [
        1050
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-continent-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_white_hair_continent",
        "loc_yellow_hair_continent",
        "char_black_hair_king"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan sends an enormous will guarded by rank five Gu worms down to Black Hair Continent. Just above the continent the will divides into two parts. One flies toward Black Hair Kingdom’s capital, and the other flies to Steel Thread City.",
      "chapters": [
        1084
